# --- Tags ---
# Tags are dynamic: any tag key on a resource becomes a column tag_key:<Key>.
# By default only Country / GroupName / Type are included.
# Use tag_key:* = IN to include every tag found, or list specific ones:
#   tag_key:Environment = IN
#   tag_key:Team = OUT
